    displayName: The Song of the Bow
    flavorText: '''How are the mighty fallen in the midst of the battle!'''
    tierType: 1
    purpose: David's own lament over Saul and Jonathan, commanded to be taught to
      the children of Judah - 'the beauty of Israel is slain upon thy high places...
      how are the mighty fallen.' An unattributed elegy, not delivered by any third
      party - David's own composed grief.
    deliveredByManagerId: 
    managerId: lament_for_saul_and_jonathan
